task now confronts him. Hurtling through space on this tiny ship, it's up to him to puzzle out an impossible scientific mystery--and conquer an extinction-level threat to  our species. And with the clock ticking down and the nearest human being light-years away, he's got to do it all alone. Or does he? An irresistible interstellar adventure as only Andy Weir could imagine it, Project Hail Mary is a tale of discovery, speculation, and survival to rival The Martian-while taking us to places it never dreamed of going\"--","identifiers":{"isbn":"9780593135204","lccn":"  2020015821","local":"1149223512"}},{"name":"eBook","type":"electronic","availability":{"isGetItSuppressed":false,"urls":["http://link.overdrive.com/?websiteID=37&titleID=5665700","https://img1.od-cdn.com/ImageType-200/0111-1/%7BC122A37F-F984-4062-8F35-1072A99305A0%7DIMG200.JPG","https://samples.overdrive.com/?crid=c122a37f-f984-4062-8f35-1072a99305a0&.epub-sample.overdrive.com","https://ebook.yourcloudlibrary.com/library/nypl-document_id-39fhrr9","https://img1.od-cdn.com/ImageType-100/0111-1/%7BC122A37F-F984-4062-8F35-1072A99305A0%7DIMG100.JPG"],"status":{"general":"CheckAvailability","electronicLocator":"Available"},"vendors":{"overdrive":{"reserveId":["C122A37F-F984-4062-8F35-1072A99305A0"]},"cloudlibrary":{"reserveId":["39fhrr9"]}},"nonCirculating":false},"recordIds":["22460217","23117027"],"materialTypes":["z"],"editions":[{"id":"072dfa17-58f8-11ec-aaa2-153d571a6ae3","availabilityStatus":"Available","callNumber":"eNYPL BOOK","hasItems":false,"recordId":"22460217","publicationDate":"2021","type":"electronic","subscriptionId":["ad1d9a74-9c4f-4dab-a2d7-de803e523f61"],"vendors":{"cloudlibrary":{"reserveId":["39fhrr9"]}},"isGetItSuppressed":false,"issuance":["monograph"],"coverUrl":{"small":"https://secure.syndetics.com/index.aspx?isbn=9780593135211/sc.gif&client=nyplvega&type=unbound&nicaption=Project+Hail+Mary+%3A+a+novel%1FWeir%2C+Andy%1FeBook","medium":"https://secure.syndetics.com/index.aspx?isbn=978